WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.527
(slow bright music)

00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:07.159
- When you start cave exploration,

00:00:07.159 --> 00:00:12.159
you're jumping into an opening
under earth where nobody,

00:00:12.161 --> 00:00:14.823
really nobody, was in before.

00:00:16.632 --> 00:00:20.270
You're the first human

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.260
in this area,

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.086
and you look into time window.

00:00:23.086 --> 00:00:25.760
We're talking millions of years actually

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.390
what you have right in front of you.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:29.790
This is a fantastic feeling.

00:00:35.781 --> 00:00:39.270
(slow cinematic music)

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.667
My name is UWE Rath,

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:44.620
and I'm a diving instructor;
and I'm living here 26 years

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.430
in the Dominican Republic.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.193
My specialty is to explore caves.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.395
When I started

00:00:52.395 --> 00:00:54.210
I was not looking for caves;

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:57.910
I was looking for some
(mumbles) old Indian stuffs.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.963
I found big cave entrances;

00:00:59.963 --> 00:01:03.595
and of course, as a diving
instructor you are interested

00:01:03.595 --> 00:01:04.510
what's going on here.

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.810
And this is when I started actually

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:08.929
to explore my first caves.

00:01:08.929 --> 00:01:12.523
I was a pioneer in cave exploration.

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:16.390
(slow bright music)

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:17.950
The Dominican Republic

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.054
has right now more than 140 caves

00:01:20.054 --> 00:01:23.010
we're still exploring;

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:25.557
and here in Bayahibe

00:01:25.557 --> 00:01:28.070
we have a nice huge National Park.

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.560
And this National Park is like,

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:31.390
ah, Swiss cheese.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:34.306
It has a huge amount of underwater caves.

00:01:34.306 --> 00:01:36.543
When I do this today,

00:01:36.543 --> 00:01:39.010
of course, you're looking
at a cave explorer

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:40.581
in a completely different way.

00:01:40.581 --> 00:01:43.182
Maybe you find a different passage

00:01:43.182 --> 00:01:47.869
or maybe you can connect
a whole bunch of caves.

00:01:47.869 --> 00:01:50.000
You're always looking really

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.813
for small openings to find new stuff.

00:01:56.081 --> 00:02:00.750
(slow bright music)

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:02.170
Diving in the open ocean,

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:04.810
when you have a small problem, you're way

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.452
out of the water is to going up.

00:02:07.452 --> 00:02:12.010
In a cave, you have an
overhead environment,

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.363
you cannot go up.

00:02:15.608 --> 00:02:17.230
When I go

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:19.060
in the ocean you have noises everywhere.

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:20.830
You can listen to the boat engines,

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:23.482
you can listen to noises under water.

00:02:23.482 --> 00:02:26.740
When you go in a cave you
will listen to nothing—

00:02:26.740 --> 00:02:29.510
just to your bubbles;
and this is for me one

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:32.230
of the most wonderful things on earth.

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:34.203
No noises at all.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.750
Cave diving is my passion,

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:45.173
and still after 20 years I love it.

00:02:46.153 --> 00:02:49.040
I love to teach people

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:52.460
to do cave diving in a safe way.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.731
I'm 59 years old, so I
need somebody behind me

00:02:55.731 --> 00:02:59.513
to do the same stuff
when I'm getting too old.

00:02:59.513 --> 00:03:01.670
This is good

00:03:01.670 --> 00:03:03.800
for me to see the young people

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:05.080
they are into

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.613
this nice, nice, nice
cave exploration thing.

00:03:08.613 --> 00:03:11.870
I'm very happy they're asking still

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.563
the old guy how to do some stuff.

